=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ M4 @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU m4 @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU m4 is free software under the GNU General Public License v3 or later.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [M4.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU m4
    At system startup: to define M4$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:M4$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the m4 command, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @M4$ROOT:[000000]M4$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE M4 removes the product and deassigns M4$ROOT.
